{"id":"3b5f15cb01","t":"The Marriage Life in the Grand Duke Family Is Too Easy, Though","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/large_download-193x278.webp","n":49,"l":49,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though"},"u":1795038300682,"desc":"تستيقظ قارئة لتجد نفسها داخل روايتها المفضلة، وقد أصبحت الزوجة الجديدة لحبيبها، فتقرر البقاء مجرد معجبة. لكنها، وبلا رادع، تجد نفسها تستحوذ على قلوب نخبة المجتمع، من والد زوجها الصريح إلى حماتها الحامية. عند هذه النقطة، يتحول زوجها، الذي كان بريئًا في السابق، إلى مغازل، مما يجعلها تتساءل من هو الخطر الحقيقي في هذا المنزل. قصة رومانسية دافئة وكوميدية تدور حول النجاة، وإغواء السذج، والتعامل مع تعقيدات زوج يتمتع بفصاحة لسان غير عادية.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-marriage-life-in-the-grand-duke-family-is-too-easy-though|/manga/the-marriage-lif